Bundled assets
--------------
All character art, animation frames, stage backgrounds, voice lines, sound
effects and music in assets/ were generated for this project with ElevenLabs
creative tools (image, video, speech, sound-effect and music models), then
processed (frame extraction, background removal, sprite packing) by the
project's own tooling. Characters, stages and names are original to this game.

Voices used (ElevenLabs voice library):
  - Rustam:     "Alaric - Intense and Measured" (English)
  - Baba Sher:  "The Doc" (English)
  - Announcer:  "David - Sports Arena Announcer" (English)

